# 3. SPEND GOVERNANCE -- the env var is superseded
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

claim clm:env-budget-was-never-a-control
  status SUPERSEDED
  verification REPRODUCED
  finding BONFYRE_RESOURCE_MAX_DAILY_SPEND_USD is declared twice with different values (25 and 75); shell sourcing is last-wins and silent
  finding no control-plane module has ever read it; it is a number in a file
  replacement the mature mechanism already existed and had simply never been wired to compute

upgrade upg:funding-routes-replace-the-constant
  status LANDED
  verification MEASURED
  organ financial_metabolism.record_funding_route / choose_funding
  property a funding route carries a depleting REMAINING balance and an authority_ref; choose_funding refuses an amount no route can absorb
  routes route:compute/anthropic $300, route:compute/openai $100, route:compute/experimental $25, all under @bonfyre/authority/operator

upgrade upg:admission-control-for-spend
  status LANDED
  verification MEASURED
  organ resource_admission.decide, written for disk after Run 6 died of ENOSPC
  why_it_transfers the failure it was built for is exactly the concurrent-spender failure: five planes each observing the same headroom and all being admitted
  demonstrated ai-leads $40 ADMIT, ai-loss $40 ADMIT, rubicon $40 ADMIT, experimental $200 REJECT (exceeds single-grant cap)
  property outstanding grants of $120 are subtracted from what the next caller may see
  units micro-USD so the integer budget arithmetic stays exact

upgrade upg:commitment-with-expiry
  status LANDED
  verification MEASURED
  organ economic_graphs.record_commitment
  recorded commit:compute/2026-08, committer @bonfyre/operator, beneficiary program K, expires 2026-09-26, authority @bonfyre/authority/operator

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE FINDING THAT MATTERS MOST
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

claim clm:spend-exceeds-budget-by-nineteen-times
  status UNRESOLVED
  verification MEASURED
  claim Measured compute spend is roughly nineteen times the declared budget, and nothing was watching.
  evidence measured Claude spend $5,748.75; declared burst budget $300; declared daily cap 25 or 75
  evidence choose_funding(USD, 5748.75) returns NO ROUTE -- the spend would be REFUSED by the mechanism that now exists
  evidence the $18.85 OpenAI spend funds fine; the entire exposure is Claude
  qualifier the $5,748.75 is priced at published list rates over the full retained transcript history, not a billing-period invoice, and Claude Code subscription terms may mean the cash cost differs; the Admin-key gap is what prevents settling that
  consequence either the budget is wrong by an order of magnitude or the spend is, and until an Anthropic Admin key resolves rung 1 the ledger cannot say which
  action_required mint an Anthropic Admin key, then reconcile the ledger against an actual invoice
